  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "两个人分站在墙的两头，贴着墙根轻声说句话，另一头的人居然能听见——这就是北京天坛的回音壁。",
      "chars": 45,
      "speech_ms": 10410,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 10410,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "靠的是什么？",
      "chars": 6,
      "speech_ms": 820,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 10810,
      "end_ms": 11630,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "一是墙围成圆弧形，声音贴着墙面，一段一段往前传，不容易散掉；",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6820,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 12030,
      "end_ms": 18850,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "二是墙面砌得平整光滑，声音在上面走，损耗小。",
      "chars": 22,
      "speech_ms": 4850,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 19250,
      "end_ms": 24100,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "古人建这堵墙时，未必算过什么声学，可这份手艺实实在在：轻声细语，顺着一堵墙，就能送到老远的另一头。",
      "chars": 49,
      "speech_ms": 10630,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 24500,
      "end_ms": 35130,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "去天坛别光看祈年殿，到回音壁和同伴分站两头，试着说句悄悄话。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 7060,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 35530,
      "end_ms": 42590,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "几百年前的墙，还在替人传话。",
      "chars": 14,
      "speech_ms": 2650,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 42990,
      "end_ms": 45640,
      "trace_id": "cached"
    }
  ]
}